            },
            "accordion_row_TwjjJc": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How do I pay in 3 interest-free installments?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_eTrqfg": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Select 3 interest-free installments to split your purchase into three payments, charged every 30 days beginning at the time your order is confirmed (usually the shipping date). You only need to add your debit or credit or debit card info you’d like to use for the automatic payments. We’ll let you know when your payment is due - you can simply sit back, relax, and enjoy your purchase. </p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_eTrqfg"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_rm6mG8": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Is there a fee to use 3 interest-free installments?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_yEfAAd": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>There are no interest charges when you choose to pay using three interest-free installments, and you will not incur any additional fees as long as each payment is made according to the schedule provided at checkout. This option is designed to give you greater flexibility by allowing you to spread your purchase amount over time without any added cost. However, it is important to be aware that if a scheduled payment is missed or not completed on time, late fees may be applied by the payment provider. For full details about how the installment plan works, including eligibility requirements, payment timelines, and potential penalties, please make sure to carefully review Klarna’s terms and conditions before completing your purchase.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
